# Accepted exceptions, one extended regex per line, matched against
# "path:line:text". Everything else the guard flags is a real leak.

# An all-zero key is a fixture, not a credential: the VNC password is
# sha256(key)[:8], so the test needs a fixed key to assert a fixed salt.
scp-(live|test)-0{32}

# pdoc renders Scrapy's own Spider.update_settings docstring, inherited by ScrapflySpider, whose FEEDS example
# names a placeholder home directory: third-party text, not a path of ours.
^docs/scrapfly/scrapy/(index|spider)\.html:[0-9]+:[[:space:]]*"/home/user/documents/items\.json"
